  "dst": {
    "_comment": [
      "Day arithmetic across DST, run in the `tz` below (never UTC): yesterday and",
      "the next ping step CALENDAR days, not 86_400_000 ms. 2026-10-25 is a 25 h",
      "day in Europe/Paris, 2026-03-29 a 23 h one; a fixed 24 h step lands on the",
      "same day or skips one. Asserted by lib/pure.js, claude-code/stamps.js,",
      "mcp/sessions.js and Swift SessionsParityTests."
    ],
    "tz": "Europe/Paris",
